Increases the target's chance to critically hit with spells by 3%. 

When the target critically hits the caster's chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 3% for 10 sec. 

@ext:Cannot be cast on self.:ext@

Fills you with the embrace of Shadow energy, causing you to be healed for 15% and other party members to be healed for $/5;15286s1% of any single-target Priest Shadow spell damage you deal. 

@ext:Either heal cannot exceed 5% of the maximum health of the caster.:ext@

@ext:This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

Surrounds you with fel energy, increasing spell damage by 40 plus 30% of your Spirit. 
Restores 2% of your max health every 5 sec. 

@ext:Only one Armor spell can be active at a time. :ext@

Strengthens you with the presence of blood, increasing damage by 2% and heals you for 1% of your damage dealt.

@ext:Only one Presence may be active at a time.:ext@

@ext:Heals up to a maximum of 5% of your health per hit.:ext@

Teleports the caster 20 yards forward.

This ability can be used while casting, but not channeling, and does not trigger a global cooldown.

@ext:This uses Blink modifiers.:ext@

Accumulate power in order to transcend into an |cFFFFFFFFAngel of Light|r or an |cFFFFFFFFAngel of Death|r.

Dealing direct Holy damage or periodic Shadow damage with spells has a chance to accumulate the respective power. Upon reaching 42 stacks of either power, the matching Angel form becomes usable.

@ext:After using a specific Angel form, you become sated for 2 min.:ext@
